---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
import "./fonts.css";
---

<section
  class="demo"
  data-demo="serif"
  lang={lang}
  data-reset-message={t(
    "Initial state restored",
    "초기 상태로 복원했습니다",
    "初期状態に戻しました",
  )}
>
  <header>
    <small>THE OBSERVER / NOTO SERIF</small>
    <p>
      {t(
        "A journal of everyday things",
        "일상의 사물을 기록하는 저널",
        "日々のものを記録する日誌",
      )}
    </p>
  </header>
  <div class="specimen">
    <span class="letter">
      H<span class="terminal top" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="terminal bottom" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </span>
    <div>
      <h2>{t("The art of noticing", "관찰의 기술", "気づく技術")}</h2>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Every detail has a story. Slow down and let the page unfold.",
          "모든 세부에는 이야기가 있습니다. 속도를 늦추고 지면을 읽어보세요.",
          "細部には物語があります。歩みを緩め、紙面を読み進めてください。",
        )}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="sample" data-sample>
    {t("River, light & time", "강과 빛, 그리고 시간", "川と光、そして時間")}
  </p>
  <div class="controls">
    <label>
      {t("Size", "크기", "サイズ")}
      <input
        data-size
        type="range"
        min="24"
        max="72"
        value="48"
        data-interactive
        disabled
      />
      <output data-size-value>48px</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <input type="checkbox" data-terminals data-interactive disabled />
      {t("Mark H terminals", "H 획 끝 표시", "Hの端を示す")}
    </label>
  </div>
  <p class="font-note">
    {t(
      "Self-hosted specimen. Latin uses the named face; Korean and Japanese use Noto CJK subsets. Other characters may use a fallback.",
      "자체 호스팅 표본. 라틴은 표시된 서체, 한·일은 Noto CJK 서브셋입니다. 다른 문자는 대체 글꼴로 표시될 수 있습니다.",
      "自前配信の見本。ラテン文字は表示の書体、韓国語・日本語はNoto CJKサブセット。ほかの文字は代替書体になる場合があります。",
    )}
  </p>
  <button class="reset" type="button" data-reset data-interactive disabled>
    {t("Reset", "초기화", "リセット")}
  </button>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
</section>
<script>
  import { mount } from "./shared";
  mount("serif", (root, say) => {
    const size = root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("[data-size]")!,
      marks = root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("[data-terminals]")!;
    const update = () => {
      root.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-sample]")!.style.fontSize =
        `${size.value}px`;
      root.querySelector("[data-size-value]")!.textContent = `${size.value}px`;
      root.dataset.terminals = String(marks.checked);
      say(
        `${size.value}px · ${marks.parentElement!.textContent}: ${marks.checked ? "✓" : "—"}`,
      );
    };
    size.addEventListener("input", update);
    marks.addEventListener("change", update);
    return () => {
      size.value = "48";
      marks.checked = false;
      update();
    };
  });
</script>
<style>
  .demo {
    min-width: 0;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px);
    color-scheme: light;
  }
  .demo * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  h2,
  h3,
  p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 18px 0;
  }
  label {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  button,
  select,
  input,
  textarea {
    font: inherit;
    max-width: 100%;
    color: inherit;
  }
  button,
  select,
  input:not([type="checkbox"]):not([type="range"]) {
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
  }
  button,
  select {
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button {
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    background: transparent;
  }
  input,
  textarea,
  select {
    background: #fff;
    color: #172329;
    border: 1px solid #67747c;
  }
  input[type="range"] {
    width: 150px;
  }
  input[type="checkbox"] {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }
  :focus-visible {
    outline: 3px dashed currentColor;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  [hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }
  [role="status"] {
    min-height: 1.5em;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  small {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .reset {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .demo * {
      transition: none !important;
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
  .demo {
    background: #fff9eb;
    color: #372c23;
    border-top: 5px solid #372c23;
  }
  header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .specimen {
    display: flex;
    gap: 26px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .specimen h2,
  .specimen p,
  .sample,
  .letter {
    font-family: "Demo Serif", var(--demo-serif-cjk, serif), serif;
  }
  .specimen h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }
  .letter {
    position: relative;
    font-size: 140px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    flex: none;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .terminal {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    left: 2%;
    width: 42%;
    height: 12%;
    border: 2px solid #b64c2b;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .top {
    top: 18%;
  }
  .bottom {
    bottom: 14%;
  }
  .demo[data-terminals="true"] .terminal {
    display: block;
  }
  .sample {
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    border-block: 1px solid #a4957d;
    padding: 20px 0;
  }
  .font-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .specimen {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
</style>
